---
description: Prepare one applyChannels evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: BrandSystem[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Generate channel-specific assets that serve actual user tasks while respecting length, format, and factual constraints. Adapt emphasis and tone to context, preserve required disclosures, and avoid treating a slogan as a substitute for useful product information. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
